    "title": "<p class=\"TableTitle\">Spectrum of histopathological features in proliferative verrucous leukoplakia <span class=\"Ref-PMID\">{33415517}</span></p>",
    "legend": "",
    "source": "Ellen Eisenberg",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"width: 74.1%; border-collapse: collapse; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" border=\"0\" width=\"74%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid; height: 68.4pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 100.0%; background: #DAEEF3; mso-background-themecolor: accent5; mso-background-themetint: 51; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 68.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"100%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Early (initial) phase: Solitary or multifocal corrugated hyperkeratotic lesion</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Corrugated, undulating, or flat, dense surface hyperorthokeratosis (usually) or hyperparakeratosis</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Surface keratin excessive relative to the width of the underlying epithelial compartment</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>+/&minus; Sharp keratin crests</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>+/&minus; Skip areas of surface orthokeratinization or parakeratinization</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Sharp, abrupt transitions from adjacent unaffected normal epithelium</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>+/&minus; Stratum granulosum</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>+/&minus; Epithelial atrophy, flattened rete ridges</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Minimal to no cytological dysplasia</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span>+/&minus;&nbsp;Lichenoid interface inflammation</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 1; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes; page-break-inside: avoid; height: 3.5pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 100.0%; background: #DAEEF3; mso-background-themecolor: accent5; mso-background-themetint: 51; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; height: 3.5pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"100%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableText\"><strong>Progressive phase: Bulky epithelial proliferation</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Undulating surface with keratin-filled crypts</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Voluminous epithelial cellular compartment</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>+/&minus; Exophytic papillary surface projections</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Rete ridges</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 72.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level2 lfo2;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Courier New';\">o<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Elongated</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 72.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level2 lfo2;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Courier New';\">o<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Endophytic down to uniform depth</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 72.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level2 lfo2;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Courier New'; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Courier New';\">o<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Bulky, broad, bulbous configuration</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Cytological atypia&nbsp;&ndash; minimal</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span>Significant architectural disturbances</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableText\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\">&middot;<span style=\"font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; font-size: 7pt; line-height: normal; font-family: 'Times New Roman';\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span>+/&minus;&nbsp;Lichenoid lymphoplasmacytic infiltrate</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>",
